## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/checkbox.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Checkbox } from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/checkbox";
</script>

<Checkbox aria-label="Accept terms" />
```

## API Reference

### Checkbox

`Checkbox` includes the COSS check and indeterminate indicators. Use `checked` for an initial value
or `bind:checked` for controlled state. Native form props and `onCheckedChange` pass to the Shards
root.

See the [Shards Checkbox API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/checkbox) for form, validation, and state
props.

